Hungryです！
It's hungry!

236
00:17:29,024 --> 00:17:30,524
腹減った、オッケー！
"I'm hungry", okay!

237
00:17:31,024 --> 00:17:33,024
じゃあ、ラオーラ！
Next, Raora!

238
00:17:33,524 --> 00:17:36,024
Very hungry!

239
