And so...

242
00:17:43,024 --> 00:17:46,024
全員正解～！
Everyone is correct~!

243
00:17:46,024 --> 00:17:48,024
Yay!

244
00:17:48,024 --> 00:17:51,524
イージー！イージー！
Easy! Easy!

245
00:17:51,524 --> 00:17:53,524
上手上手！
Well done!

246
