248
00:18:01,024 --> 00:18:02,524
じゃあ行きます！
Here we go!

249
00:18:02,524 --> 00:18:05,524
「チンしてね！」の意味は？
What is the meaning of "Chin shite ne!"?

250
00:18:06,024 --> 00:18:08,024
Oh!

251
00:18:09,024 --> 00:18:13,024
「チンしてね！」「チンしてね！」
"Chin shite ne!" "Chin shite ne!"

252
00:18:13,024 --> 00:18:16,024
「チンしてね！」
"Chin shite ne!"

253
00:18:23,024 --> 00:18:26,024
可愛い可愛い！
So cute, so cute!

254
00:18:26,024 --> 00:18:28,024
「チンしてね」
"Chin shite ne"

255
00:18:31,024 --> 00:18:33,524
「チンしてね！」
"Chin shite ne!"

256
00:18:33,524 --> 00:18:36,024
「チンしてね！」
"Chin shite ne!"

257
00:18:42,024 --> 00:18:45,024
分かるかな？声に出したら分かるかもよ？
Do you know it? Maybe if you say it out loud you'll get it?

258
00:18:45,024 --> 00:18:48,024
「チン」
"Chin"

259
00:18:49,524 --> 00:18:51,524
可愛い！
Cute!

260
00:18:52,024 --> 00:18:54,024
これじゃないの？
Isn't it this?

261
00:18:57,024 --> 00:18:59,024
オッケーかな？
Are you ready?

262
00:19:00,024 --> 00:19:03,024
ココな、ちょっと下にし...
Around here... I'll put it down a bit...

263
00:19:06,024 --> 00:19:09,024
はい、じゃあ聞きますか。
Alright, shall we check the answers?

264
00:19:09,024 --> 00:19:11,024
ヨッピー、どうでしょう？
Yoppy, what did you put?

265
00:19:11,024 --> 00:19:12,024
はい！
Yes!

266
00:19:12,024 --> 00:19:15,024
最初はちょっと doorbell だったんだけど...
At first I thought doorbell...

267
00:19:15,024 --> 00:19:18,024
...あれピンポンだから、チンしたら Microwave...
...but that's ping-pong, so "chin" means microwave...

268
00:19:18,024 --> 00:19:21,024
あ、Microwave！
Ah, microwave!

269
00:19:21,024 --> 00:19:24,024
温める...
To warm up...

270
00:19:24,024 --> 00:19:28,024
電子レンジ終わったら「チン」ってなるじゃない。
When the microwave finishes, it goes "chin".

271
00:19:28,024 --> 00:19:30,024
なるほど！オッケー！
I see! Okay!

272
00:19:30,024 --> 00:19:32,024
じゃあ、こぼちゃんは？
Then, how about Kobo-chan?

273
00:19:33,024 --> 00:19:36,024
こぼちゃん...
Kobo-chan...

274
00:19:37,024 --> 00:19:39,024
なんか「チン」は...
Somehow "chin" is...

275
00:19:39,024 --> 00:19:41,024
ちょっと...
A bit...

276
00:19:41,024 --> 00:19:45,024
いやいやいや！危険！
No no no! Dangerous!

277
00:19:46,024 --> 00:19:49,024
そんなものみたい...
Looks like that kind of thing...

278
00:19:49,024 --> 00:19:52,024
「チン」は...
"Chin" is...

279
00:19:54,524 --> 00:19:58,024
Pee please? Pee please?

280
00:20:00,032 --> 00:20:03,032
多分...わかんない！
I probably... don't know!

281
00:20:03,332 --> 00:20:06,532
なるほど。じゃあ次行きますか？ジジ、ジジ！
I see. Shall we move to the next person? Zeta, Zeta!

282
00:20:07,532 --> 00:20:10,532
わからなーい！
I don't know~!

283
00:20:14,532 --> 00:20:18,032
チンやばい！やばい！
"Chin" is dangerous! It's dangerous!

284
00:20:18,032 --> 00:20:22,532
チンやばい！No やばい！
"Chin" is dangerous! No, it's not!

285
00:20:24,532 --> 00:20:27,532
じゃあ、ベーちゃんお願いたします！
Then Bae-chan, please go ahead!

286
00:20:28,032 --> 00:20:35,532
はい。レンジのチンですね。温めてねっていうことで...
Yes. It's "chin" from a microwave. Meaning "warm it up"...

287
00:20:36,532 --> 00:20:38,832
はいはいはい。じゃあ最後、ラオラ！
Right right right. And finally, Raora!

288
00:20:39,532 --> 00:20:44,532
えー、わからなーい！わからなーい！
Uh, I don't know... I don't know!

289
00:20:45,032 --> 00:20:50,032
Maybe... maybe something like...

290
00:20:50,032 --> 00:20:55,532
Maybe when the glass, when you touch the glass...

291
00:20:55,532 --> 00:21:04,532
ガラス？ああ～！チンって音？
Glass? Ah~! The "chin" clinking sound?

292
00:21:05,032 --> 00:21:10,532
Not やばい. No やばいね. Not やばい.
Not bad. No, it's not bad. Not bad.

293
00:21:11,532 --> 00:21:21,032
正解は... microwave! チン！
The correct answer is... microwave! "Chin"!

294
00:21:21,532 --> 00:21:26,532
ご飯を温めてくださいっていう...
It means "Please warm up the food"...

295
00:21:27,532 --> 00:21:34,032
電子レンジでご飯温めてって言いたい時に...
When you want to say "Warm up the food in the microwave"...

296
00:21:34,532 --> 00:21:48,032
例えばご飯を置いておいて、後から帰ってきた人に「チンしてね」ってメモを残したりしますね。
For example, if you leave food out, you might leave a note for someone coming home later saying "Chin shite ne".

297
00:21:48,532 --> 00:21:52,532
へぇ～！なるほど！
Whoa~! I see!

298
00:21:53,032 --> 00:22:00,032
If someone says "Chin shite ne", it's like "Please warm it up for me".

299
00:22:00,032 --> 00:22:05,532
Okay, so if you wanna... if you wanna say "Pee, please"...

300
00:22:06,032 --> 00:22:09,532
How do you say that? I might need that one!

301
00:22:10,032 --> 00:22:14,032
No pee! No pee!

302
00:22:14,032 --> 00:22:19,532
じゃあ『Pee』はどう言ったらいいの？
Then how do you say "pee"?

303
00:22:20,032 --> 00:22:25,532
オノマトペ？『Pee please』って何？
An onomatopoeia? What is "Pee please"?

304
00:22:25,532 --> 00:22:31,532
『Pee』はおしっこ？
Does "Pee" mean urination?

305
00:22:32,032 --> 00:22:38,032
あ、じゃあ『しー』とか『しゃー』とか...
Ah, then like "shh" or "shaa"...

306
00:22:38,032 --> 00:22:44,032
しゃー please! しゃー please!
"Shaa" please! "Shaa" please!

307
00:22:44,532 --> 00:22:49,532
しゃー、しーとか...
"Shaa", "shh", etc...

308
00:22:49,532 --> 00:22:54,032
No no no! だめ、だめよ！
No no no! Don't say that!

309
00:22:54,532 --> 00:23:00,032
すみません、しゃーお願い！
Excuse me, "shaa" please!

310
00:23:00,032 --> 00:23:06,032
間違った日本語教えてる！
You're teaching wrong Japanese!

311
00:23:07,532 --> 00:23:10,832
やばい！じゃあ次行きましょう！
Oh boy! Okay, let's move to the next one!

312
00:23:11,032 --> 00:23:18,032
静まり返ったとき、めっちゃ静かなとき使うオノマトペは何でしょうか？
What is the onomatopoeia used when everything goes completely silent?

313
00:23:19,032 --> 00:23:24,032
What's the onomatopoeia that they use when it goes really quiet?

314
00:23:25,532 --> 00:23:28,532
Ah, maybe I remember!

315
00:23:31,032 --> 00:23:35,032
あ、なんだっけ？静かなとき...
Ah, what was it again? When it's quiet...

316
00:23:36,032 --> 00:23:44,032
Like when it goes really quiet all of a sudden, what's the onomatopoeia that they would use?

317
00:23:45,032 --> 00:23:53,032
You can write it in romaji, or we can just sound it out.

318
00:23:57,032 --> 00:24:05,032
漫画読んだらわかるかもね。漫画に書いてあることもあるかも。
You might know if you read manga. It's often written in manga.

319
00:24:06,532 --> 00:24:13,032
It might be in manga that you've read before.

320
00:24:13,532 --> 00:24:21,532
I don't know how to spell it... まあ、いいでしょう！
I don't know how to spell it... Well, it should be fine!

321
00:24:22,032 --> 00:24:27,532
じゃあ聞いていきますね。イオフィから！
Okay, let me ask everyone. Starting with Iofi!

322
00:24:28,032 --> 00:24:36,032
はい、『しーん』！シンプル！
Yes, "sheen"! Simple!

323
00:24:37,032 --> 00:24:45,032
続いて、こぼちゃん！
Next up, Kobo-chan!

324
00:24:46,032 --> 00:24:52,032
じゃあ、ジジ！
Next, Zeta!

325
00:24:52,032 --> 00:24:59,832
しゃー！ Isn't that the pee?
"Shaa!" Isn't that the pee?

326
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:02,540
"Well, wouldn't it get quiet after you pee?"

327
00:25:07,540 --> 00:25:09,540
じゃあ続いて、ベーちゃん！
Next up, Bae-chan!

328
00:25:10,540 --> 00:25:14,040
いやー、忘れた... なんか... すー...
Ah, I forgot... like, "suu..."

329
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:15,040
あー、すー...
Ah, "suu..."

330
00:25:15,040 --> 00:25:15,840
違う！
No!

331
00:25:15,840 --> 00:25:17,840
すーはちょっと違うか...
"Suu" is a bit off...

332
00:25:18,040 --> 00:25:19,240
しーになったか！
Did it become "shii"?

333
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:21,040
いや、どっちかと思ってたんだよね。
Yeah, I was wondering which one it was.

334
00:25:21,040 --> 00:25:22,540
なるほど、なるほど。
I see, I see.

335
00:25:25,840 --> 00:25:27,240
お、ミー？
Oh, me?

336
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:28,040
うん、Yes.
Yep, yes.

337
00:25:28,540 --> 00:25:31,040
Yeah, I think it's "shii".

338
00:25:31,540 --> 00:25:37,040
Like, I remember when I read some mangas, I might be wrong...

339
00:25:37,540 --> 00:25:39,540
Maybe it's "shii".

340
00:25:40,040 --> 00:25:44,240
うん、しー。オッケー、オッケー。
Mm, "shii". Okay, okay.

341
00:25:45,040 --> 00:25:47,540
じゃあ正解に行きましょう！
Now, let's reveal the correct answer!

342
00:25:47,540 --> 00:25:50,540
正解は... 「しー」でございます！
The correct answer is... "Shii"!

343
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:56,540
やっぱり！ベーちゃんとGigiが正解だね！
That's it! Bae-chan and Gigi got it right!

344
00:25:56,540 --> 00:25:58,840
You were so close, Gigi!

345
00:25:58,840 --> 00:26:02,840
Gigi was "Shii-n"?

346
00:26:03,040 --> 00:26:05,540
しーん。
"Shii-n."

347
00:26:05,540 --> 00:26:08,540
「ん」が必要ですね、コボちゃん。
You needed an "n", Kobo-chan.

348
00:26:10,040 --> 00:26:13,040
あらららら！惜しい！
Oh dear! So close!

349
00:26:14,540 --> 00:26:17,540
まあまあ、十分十分。
Well, close enough.

350
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:20,540
じじは絶対違うからね！
Jiji was definitely wrong!

351
00:26:20,840 --> 00:26:23,540
「しゃー」は流石におしっこじゃないですか？
Isn't "shaa" the sound of peeing?

352
00:26:23,840 --> 00:26:27,540
そう、さっきの「ピー」の音が...
Right, the "pee" sound earlier...

353
00:26:30,240 --> 00:26:33,540
一応なんか理性的にも間違ってないと思うんすけどね。
Logically speaking, I don't think it's entirely wrong.

354
00:26:33,540 --> 00:26:38,040
じじがおしっこした後にさ、静かになるじゃん。
After Jiji goes pee, it gets quiet, right?

355
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:39,040
そうそう！
Right, right!

356
00:26:39,040 --> 00:26:40,540
だから「しゃー」！
That's why "shaa"!

357
00:26:44,040 --> 00:26:46,040
I was explaining your logic.

358
00:26:46,040 --> 00:26:48,540
Oh okay, thank you. So you're defending me?

359
00:26:48,540 --> 00:26:50,040
Yeah, I'm defending you.

360
00:26:50,540 --> 00:26:53,840
続いて行きましょう。続いて！
Let me move on to the next one. Next!

361
00:26:54,540 --> 00:27:00,040
「とっても冷たい飲み物」を表すオノマトペは何でしょうか？
